  title: Fog Information
  key: 16
  topic: 3
  boardContentText: 'Fog is affected by lighthouse light intensity


    Fog could
    be hiding important structures'
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: 'EMIL: My audio diary. Next entry.

    [pause]

    EMIL: ...That''s
    curious.

    [pause, short breath, surprised]

    EMIL: After a long time...
    I suddenly feel like discovering something.

    [brief silence]

    EMIL: The
    lighthouse... it''s like it''s pushing the fog away. Changing the intensity.
    ...That''s not normal. But it''s happening.

    [pause]

    EMIL: I''m in awe
    of it.

    [pause]

    EMIL: Part of me wonders if I''ve finally lost my mind
    out here in the solitude. ...But no. What I''m seeing is real.

    [click]'
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
